<title>USA: Spieker acquires 3 office properties.</title>
<headline>Spieker acquires 3 office properties.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spieker Properties on Tuesday said it has completed the acquisition of three office properties with over 545,000 square feet of rentable space for a total investment of $78.3 million.</p>
<p>Spieker said one property is in Redwood Shores, Calif., a suburb south of San Francisco, a second is in Bothell, Wash. near Seattle and the third is in the city of Brea in Orange County, California.</p>
